{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月17日，特斯拉CEO埃隆·馬斯克在社交平台X發文稱，美國聯邦航空管理局（FAA）此前曾獲準免費使用星鏈衞星通信服務，但美國交通部長肖恩·達菲認為沒有必要接受。馬斯克表示，近期發生的航空通信系統故障證明，FAA實際上需要這項服務。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586754.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:49:41.836119+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:25:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:42:58.422763+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:42:58.422763+00:00","content_hash":"f72440fbb7540cf112b62f30404016037aed3adcbe7a3eb69694ab8ad88b6cb8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}